MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

April 19, 2021
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #S-16-21 for a Contract between the City of Cheyenne and
Craig Construction Services LLC, for the Cheyenne Aquatics Center Main Pool
Diving Boards Removal & Replacement
______________________________________________
Two (2) bidders responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.

The Two (2) bids were received from:

1. Associated Pool Builders Inc.  Bismarck, North Dakota.
2. Craig Construction Services.  Laramie, Wyoming.

The bids were reviewed by Teresa Moore (CRE), Jason Sanchez (CRE), and Desiree Crosier
(Aquatics).

Their recommendation is to accept the lowest responsive bid from Craig Construction Services
LLC.  The bid award is for $62,230.00

Funding:
011-21-2111-42-86980 (Project # TBD) Laramie County Rec Board Grant
$15,000.00
011-21-2111-42-86300 (Project 210062) Miscellaneous Non Federal Grants
$10,000.00
030-21-2111-40-43105 (Project 130005) Special Purpose Option Tax – Overage
Projects
$37,230.00

Total $62,230.00
```

